## Interface: 30300
## Title: Raid Recruiter
## Notes: Two tools for running a raid. Recruiting: posts your LFM message to the channels you pick on a timer and collects everyone who whispers you into a sortable applicant list with their item level, level and role, and works out the role of everyone already in your raid by inspecting their build when they are close enough. Loot rolls: puts a boss drop up for roll in /rw, tracks who rolled what, and hands the item to the winner -- from the corpse by master loot, or by trade when you already looted it into your own bags. /rr
## Author: Deniz
